---
import PageLayout from '../../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
const lang = 'en';
---
<PageLayout title="Herbal Powder Sourcing" description="A procurement inquiry, not a fixed powder catalogue" lang={lang} heroTitle="Herbal Powder Sourcing" heroSubtitle="A procurement inquiry, not a fixed powder catalogue">
  <section class="section-padding"><div class="container-wide">
    <p class="max-w-3xl text-lg text-gray-600 mb-10">Tell us which botanical powder you need. Each request begins with a feasibility review; this page does not confirm stock, processing capability or an available grade.</p>
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6"><article class="bg-off-white rounded-xl p-6"><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">Identify the material</h2><p class="mt-3 text-gray-600">Provide the botanical and Latin name, plant part, origin preferences and whether you need a milled whole plant or a powdered extract.</p></article>
<article class="bg-off-white rounded-xl p-6"><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">Define acceptance criteria</h2><p class="mt-3 text-gray-600">Share target particle size and test method, moisture limits, microbial and contaminant requirements, and any carrier or additive restrictions.</p></article>
<article class="bg-off-white rounded-xl p-6"><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">Set the purchasing context</h2><p class="mt-3 text-gray-600">Include destination market, intended use, trial quantity, expected order volume, packaging and timing.</p></article></div>
    <div class="mt-10 max-w-3xl"><p class="text-gray-600">Availability, samples, testing documents, price and lead time depend on the material and supplier review. Agree the specification and commercial conditions in writing before ordering; only written confirmation establishes an offer.</p>
      <a href="/contact" class="inline-block mt-6 px-6 py-3 rounded-lg bg-primary text-white">Send a brief for feasibility review</a>
    </div>
  </div></section>
</PageLayout>
